Part 4: fonts
=============

assets/fonts/ holds Arimo, Cousine and Tinos, which the drawing renderer
draws a drawing's TrueType styles with, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(assets/fonts/OFL-1.1.txt). assets/fonts/NOTICE.md gives each face's
copyright and version.


Part 5: the sandboxed frame app
===============================

dist/frame/app/ is a built page (`@exav/viewer/frame`) that carries every
engine, minified: besides this package's code, modules and fonts, it bundles
pdfjs-dist (Apache-2.0; its ICC engine qcms, MIT), @silurus/ooxml (MIT),
three (MIT) and @exav/unpack-wasm (MIT). Of
pdfjs-dist's wasm/, only qcms is in it: its OpenJPEG and PDFium decoders are
not, this package's take their place. dist/frame/app/licenses/ holds each
one's licence and notice files, as installed when the package was built,
and README.txt lists their versions.
